ing machine."},{"role":"how","text":"Its wheel spins and cuts, and a belt carries the mud out."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But now the long, closed tunnel fills with smoky air."},{"role":"fix3","text":"So you add big fans that push in fresh air."},{"role":"fact","text":"In the Holland Tunnel, 84 fans change all its air every 90 seconds."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add a road and lights along the ceiling."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a tunnel under a river."}]}